thread:
marina_docs: Quick PSA — a customer hit an issue where our Console embed silently fails when their site has a strict frame-ancestors CSP. Support ticket #798. We should add a short troubleshooting section to the Console embed doc with a tiny JS fallback and a server-header example. Also the inline link to security headers is stale.

samira: I can draft a minimal troubleshooting block: one-paragraph explanation, a 2-line React example using postMessage to detect readiness, and an nginx header snippet. Will keep it focused.

alex_d: Can you also include a one-line note about the consequences for analytics (some customers lose page-view attribution if they rely on the iframe firing). Worth a short callout.

samira: Good call. I'll add: "If your analytics rely on events inside the iframe, prefer the postMessage handshake or server-to-server events."

marina_docs: Also discovered our docs link /security/csp returns 404; should point to /security/headers. It's referenced from docs/console/embed.md around the troubleshooting section.

deploy-bot: CI: broken link detected -> /security/csp (documentation).

samira: Draft PR: https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/1209 12 — includes: short troubleshooting note, React and vanilla examples, nginx Content-Security-Policy frame-ancestors snippet, X-Frame-Options fallback, and the link fix. Kept examples tiny.

alex_d: Sharing a tiny example suggestion for the React snippet:

```jsx
// react minimal handshake
useEffect(() => {
  function onMsg(e){ if (e.data === 'rw:ready') setReady(true); }
  window.addEventListener('message', onMsg);
  return () => window.removeEventListener('message', onMsg);
}, []);
```

samira: Added that. Also added a two-second timeout fallback that shows a help panel with directions (CSP/frame-ancestors, contact support).

taylan: +1 on the timeout fallback. Can we also add a short test checklist for Support: repro steps (browser, console errors, iframe presence), and a link to the deploy preview.

samira: Added a Support checklist comment in the PR and the deploy preview link: https://deploy-preview-1209--docs.redwood.ai/console/embed#troubleshooting.

deploy-bot: Lint: pass. Linkcheck: failing -> /security/csp -> now fixed in PR.

marina_docs: After merge, I'll open a short support-watch to monitor tickets for 48 hours and ensure the guide reduces confusion. If customers on the older Console need it, we'll backport a one-line note to /v1/console.

samira: Merged PR 1209. Thanks for reviews. Closing this thread; follow-ups in support ticket #798 and docs issue #442.
